We had an incredible day jigging Bluefin Tuna  44 miles southeast of Fire Island Inlet on my friend Chris Carangi's boat &quot;Comanche&quot; . Our crew was Chris's son Nick and my two boys Jake and Max along with Pete Mercier &amp; Tommy Hoyler. Our biggest fish was 91 pounds and all fish were caught on  Pink jigs.&lt;br /&gt;
 &lt;br /&gt;
Jack Albanese
